%% 04-color.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 4 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% %fore, %back, the color vocabulary (X11 names, grayNN, #hex), %bar.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "gray10", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Color

deck 4 of 10: fore, back, names, bars
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Two directives

	%fore "color" - the text color from here on
	%back "color" - the page background
		set %back at the TOP of a page,
		before anything is drawn
	this deck's defaults: white on gray10
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Three ways to name a color

%left, size 5
%fore "SpringGreen"
"SpringGreen" - an X11 color name
%fore "gray70"
"gray70" - gray0 (black) to gray100 (white)
%fore "#ff8c00"
"#ff8c00" - hex RRGGBB, any color at all
%size 4, fore "gray70"

names are case-insensitive; #f80 shorthand works too
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

A useful palette

%size 5, center
%fore "red"
red
%fore "orange"
orange
%fore "gold"
gold
%fore "SpringGreen"
SpringGreen
%fore "DeepSkyBlue"
DeepSkyBlue
%fore "orchid"
orchid
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%bar - horizontal rules

%size 4, fore "white", left
a bar under a heading:
%bar "gold"
four arguments: color, thickness, start, length
%bar "SpringGreen" 20 10 80
thickness is permille of screen height;
start and length are percent of screen width
%bar "red" 15 0 33
%bar "gold" 15 33 34
%bar "SpringGreen" 15 67 33
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Contrast rules

	light text on a dark ground projects best
	keep ONE accent color for emphasis
	test with the gray ramp:
		gray70 on gray10 reads fine
		gray30 on gray10 disappears
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 05-alignment.mgp
